OL,3,GNEWSALegal action taken against        
OL,4,A'prolific flag erector'                
OL,6,FA city's "most prolific flag erector"  
OL,7,Fhas been hit with a legal warning ahead
OL,8,Fof potential court action.             
OL,10,FBristol City Council said it has handed
OL,11,Fthe person they believe responsible for
OL,12,Fputting up the most flags across the   
OL,13,Fcity a cease and desist letter - the   
OL,14,Ffirst step in a legal process.         
OL,16,FAt a meeting on Friday, councillor     
OL,17,FStephen Williams said the council will 
OL,18,Fsee what effect that has on the city's 
OL,19,F"most prolific flag erector" before    
OL,20,Fdeciding next steps.                   
