OL,6,FFlags started being put up across the  
OL,7,Fcountry in 2025 as activists said they 
OL,8,Fwanted to celebrate patriotism. But    
OL,9,Fcouncil leaders said in August they had
OL,10,Fspent about #50,000 removing flags and 
OL,11,Fwarned people could face prison if they
OL,12,Fcontinued.                             
